            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"map65-auc-hands-on-seminar\">MAP\u226465 AUC hands-on seminar</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">This notebook reproduces the analysis in <code>map65_2026May18.py</code> step by step.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Main flow:</span>\n<ol>\n<li>Load and prepare the dataset</li>\n<li>Estimate the propensity score</li>\n<li>Apply overlap weighting</li>\n<li>Check covariate balance with SMD and a love plot</li>\n<li>Compare MAP\u226465 AUC before and after weighting</li>\n<li>Export tables and figures</li>\n</ol>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The unweighted Table 1 functions are imported from <code>my_mod.py</code> or <code>my_mod_2026May.py</code>.\nPropensity-score weighting functions are imported from <code>psweight.py</code>, so the notebook stays short and reusable.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
